      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "This is the thing: for event-based ADC, you have different metrics. You can not really define a \"general\" sample rate and resolution since it depends on the input signal and its instantaneous slope.\nSee here: https://www.researchgate.net/publication/396348843_Event-Based_ADCs_vs_Nyquist_ADCs_Rethinking_Performance_Metrics",
      "author": {
